"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SeedNode"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "showAdvanced": true, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [65, 68], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}, {"name": "seconds", "links": [66], "label": "seconds", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "seconds"}], "size": [472.5835876464844, 539.236328125], "pos": [1850.0927734375, 607.8363037109375], "widgets_values": ["Traditional Chinese-inspired lyrical song, strong ancient Chinese aesthetic, intimate and poetic female vocal, restrained and natural singing, pentatonic melodic language, modal Chinese melody, free-flowing phrasing, elegant and melancholic atmosphere.\n\nPipa as the main rhythmic and melodic instrument, guzheng answering phrases, xiao flute carrying long breathy melodic lines, subtle erhu textures, sparse ruan and traditional Chinese percussion. Minimal Western instrumentation, no dominant piano, no pop string pads, no drum kit.\n\nSparse acoustic arrangement, spacious pauses, delicate ornamentation, traditional Chinese instrumental interplay, melody-led rather than chord-led harmony. Avoid standard Western pop chord progressions.\n\nRainy ancient town at night, stone alleys, lantern reflections, mist, distant bells, quiet sorrow, classical Chinese poetry atmosphere.\n\nShort atmospheric instrumental opening, storytelling vocal sections, gradual emotional development without a big pop chorus, restrained climax, instrumental interludes led by pipa and xiao, lingering instrumental outro.\n\nAuthentic Chinese acoustic timbres, natural room ambience, subtle spacious reverb, cinematic only in atmosphere rather than orchestration.\n\nNo EDM, no synth-pop, no pop-rock drums, no big power-ballad chorus, no glossy commercial pop production, no excessive Western orchestral strings, no excessive opera-style singing, no artist imitation.", "[Intro]\n城门鼓歇 雨落无声\n我在旧约里等一个人\n\n[Verse 1]\n我从霸桥折柳启程\n一路问过几处驿门\n你说上元灯火将明\n便在朱雀街头相认\n我把青色旧伞撑开\n站过午后又站到黄昏\n卖花人收起最后一枝春\n仍不见你穿过人群\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n雨打湿袖口的字\n那封信还握在掌心\n\n[Chorus]\n长安落雨不逢君\n我把一生等成一城黄昏\n灯火照过千万张脸\n没有一张是旧时故人\n长安落雨不逢君\n风把约定吹过十二城门\n若你也曾向这里赶来\n为何我们错在同一个时辰\n\n[Verse 2]\n客栈掌灯问我姓名\n我只说等一场雨停\n窗外马蹄来来又去\n每一声都像你的回音\n后来听闻北去的路\n去年冬天封了数旬\n我忽然不敢再追问\n怕答案比等待更冷\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n纸上墨痕已经晕开\n你的名字仍旧分明\n\n[Chorus]\n长安落雨不逢君\n我把一生等成一城黄昏\n灯火照过千万张脸\n没有一张是旧时故人\n长安落雨不逢君\n风把约定吹过十二城门\n若你也曾向这里赶来\n为何我们错在同一个时辰\n\n[Bridge]\n多年以后又过长安\n旧街已经换了行人\n有人在檐下借我一把伞\n像你当年说话的声音\n\n[Final Chorus]\n长安又雨仍不逢君\n我终于不再追问那年缘分\n把没有寄出的信放入水中\n看它越过桥下的年轮\n长安落雨不必逢君\n有些约定只负责照亮一程\n我转身走进万家灯火\n从此也做自己的归人", 222, "fixed", 240.00000000000006, 1.7, 50], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 64, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "caption"}, "name": "caption", "link": 84, "label": "caption", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "caption"}, {"widget": {"name": "lyrics"}, "name": "lyrics", "link": 82, "label": "lyrics", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "lyrics"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "link": 73, "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_duration"}, "name": "max_duration", "link": 85, "label": "max_duration", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "max_duration"}, {"widget": {"name": "cfg_scale"}, "name": "cfg_scale", "label": "cfg_scale", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "cfg_scale"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_k"}, "name": "top_k", "label": "top_k", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "top_k"}], "flags": {}, "id": 45, "type": "MiniMaxMusic3TextEncode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.31.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {"seed": true}, "Node name for S&R": "MiniMaxMusic3TextEncode"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [85], "label": "FLOAT", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "浮点"}], "size": [270, 58], "pos": [581.66455078125, 1022.8626098632812], "widgets_values": [240], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 61, "type": "PrimitiveFloat", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveFloat"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["## MiniMax Music 3\n\nMiniMax 推出的音乐生成模型，可生成最长 **5 分钟** 的完整歌曲，具备稳定的歌曲结构和较高的音频质量。模型主要由两个输入驱动：**Caption（音乐描述）**（结构化的音乐描述，包括：风格、情绪、人声、编曲）和 **Lyrics（歌词）**（通过 `[intro]` `[verse]` `[chorus]` `[bridge]` `[outro]` 标签控制歌曲结构）。\n\n### 参数\n\n| 参数 | 描述 |\n|---|---|\n| Caption | 音乐描述。按照三个部分编写 —— 全局元数据（Global Metadata）→ 人声细节（Vocal Details）→ 编曲（Arrangement）。描述越具体，生成结果就越接近预期。 |\n| Lyrics | 歌曲歌词 + 段落结构标签。标签是唯一可执行的结构控制指令；歌词文本本身仅用于传达情绪和内容。 |\n| max_duration | 目标歌曲时长，单位为秒（默认 120 秒 = 2 分钟；模型最高支持约 300 秒 / 5 分钟）。歌曲越长，生成所需时间和显存越多。 |\n| seed | 生成时使用的随机种子。保持相同的 seed 可以复现相同的歌曲；修改 seed 可以获得不同版本的生成结果。 |\n| Model files | 模型文件，包括 diffusion model / text encoder / VAE。 |\n| Tiled decode | 使用重叠分块的方式解码音频 VAE，可大幅降低显存占用 —— 对生成长歌曲或低显存 GPU 非常有帮助。速度会稍慢，并存在轻微的分块边界接缝风险；如果使用高显存 GPU，建议关闭该选项以获得最佳音质。 |\n\n### 提示词编写指南\n\n你可以在这里找到官方的 [Music Caption Rewriter Skill](https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/MiniMax-Music3)。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: MiniMax Music 3", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [520, 660], "pos": [1824.9912109375, 1206.7149658203125], "id": 39, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [270, 314.0001220703125], "pos": [2127.552490234375, -109.6770248413086], "widgets_values": ["2b07e1d18fa066be7814fe78bfa36b3ca2806141df1d27cdb920ddfafd3b6bc2.jpg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 63, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "audio", "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "size": [210, 106], "pos": [3042.846435546875, 1201.284423828125], "widgets_values": ["audio/audio_minimax_music3", "mp3", "V0"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 79, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "format"}, "name": "format", "label": "format", "type": "COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3", "localized_name": "format"}, {"widget": {"name": "format.quality"}, "name": "format.quality", "label": "format.quality", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quality"}], "flags": {}, "id": 35, "type": "SaveAudioAdvanced", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.31.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudioAdvanced"}, "order": 17}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "size": [323.8132019042969, 88], "pos": [2677.621337890625, 1215.0145263671875], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 81, "label": "音频", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "音频UI"}], "flags": {}, "id": 56, "type": "PreviewAudio", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewAudio"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [82], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [442.6491394042969, 598.8948974609375], "pos": [423.10015869140625, 1187.523193359375], "widgets_values": ["[Intro]\n风越过没有名字的山\n月亮比驿路更长\n\n[Verse 1]\n今夜营火烧得很低\n马铃停在远处山岗\n我把冻硬的墨慢慢磨开\n在纸上先写一句安康\n不敢说风像刀一样\n不敢说旧伤又在夜里发烫\n只问门前那畦青菜\n今年是不是长得寻常\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n家书写得越平常\n想念越无处躲藏\n\n[Chorus]\n塞上的月照着故乡\n是否也落在母亲的窗\n她若看见同一轮光\n会不会知道我正抬头望\n塞上的月照着故乡\n把千里风沙照成白霜\n我把不能说的苦都折进信里\n只留下四个字 一切如常\n\n[Verse 2]\n同行的人梦里喊了乳名\n醒来笑说只是风响\n我们交换家乡的样子\n有人说稻田 有人说海港\n我说院里有一棵枣树\n父亲总把最甜的留在筐\n等下一次雁群向南\n这封信也许就能到家\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n山河把人带得很远\n一轮月把路重新照短\n\n[Chorus]\n塞上的月照着故乡\n是否也落在母亲的窗\n她若看见同一轮光\n会不会知道我正抬头望\n塞上的月照着故乡\n把千里风沙照成白霜\n我把不能说的苦都折进信里\n只留下四个字 一切如常\n\n[Bridge]\n若我回去时已不再年轻\n请让旧门仍朝南开\n让我先摸一摸那棵枣树\n再说这些年走过的关山\n\n[Final Chorus]\n塞上的月照向故乡\n也照着每个远行人的方向\n我们把姓名留给风沙\n把最软的一面留在家书上\n塞上的月照向故乡\n今夜请替我落在那扇窗\n等天明驿马再次出发\n我会沿着月光慢慢还乡"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 57, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [84], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [442.6491394042969, 598.8948974609375], "pos": [903.1986083984375, 1191.9454345703125], "widgets_values": ["Mandarin Chinese cinematic frontier guofeng, 84 BPM, 4/4, steady resonant male vocal, dizi and xiao, low Chinese drums, plucked ruan, bowed strings, subtle horse-bell texture, wide open desert atmosphere, restrained verse and expansive chorus, strong but not militaristic, organic acoustic timbres, gradual crescendo, no electronic drop, no aggressive rock distortion, no artist imitation."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 58, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [270, 314.0001220703125], "pos": [1712.793701171875, -115.0588607788086], "widgets_values": ["pasted/e526c4bc5af99b22a1013a180b2ac7668be1267448376cd5709cdd3e5a4c14dc.png", "image"], "inpu